@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### List: 발행
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/list/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"list-order-1","productId":"1","quantity":2}

### List: 하나 처리 (빈 큐는 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/list/process-next

### Pub/Sub: 먼저 실행해 SSE 연결 유지. 다른 요청 탭에서 발행
GET {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/pubsub/subscribe
Accept: text/event-stream

### Pub/Sub: 발행 결과는 수신 구독자 수
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/pubsub/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"pubsub-order-1","productId":"1","quantity":2}

### Stream: 발행
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/stream/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"stream-order-1","productId":"1","quantity":2}

### Stream: 그룹 생성 (기존 그룹은 EXISTS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/stream/group

### Stream: 신규 이벤트 처리 후 ACK
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/stream/process?consumer=worker-1

### Stream: 동일 소비자의 pending 재처리
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/order-events/stream/process?consumer=worker-1&pending=true
